           <item row="15" column="1" colspan="2">
            <widget class="QCheckBox" name="chkDeskAgents">
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>Windows are enumerated on the desktop of the process asking, and no privilege changes that: a process cannot list another session's windows. With this on, a small helper is started inside each logged-on session and reports what it can see there, so the Windows tab works for other users' processes - and for every process, when TaskExplorer is running as a service. It costs one small process per session and is off unless you ask for it.</string>
             </property>
             <property name="text">
              <string>See windows on other desktops (starts a helper per session)</string>
