                 <property name="text">
                  <string>Maintaining and improving TaskExplorer is an ongoing process. Your support keeps it going and pays for the work that goes into it. You can support TaskExplorer by &lt;a href=&quot;https://xanasoft.com/go.php?to=task-contribute&quot;&gt;contributing to the project&lt;/a&gt;, by &lt;a href=&quot;https://xanasoft.com/go.php?to=task-get-cert&quot;&gt;obtaining a supporter certificate&lt;/a&gt;, by &lt;a href=&quot;https://xanasoft.com/go.php?to=patreon&quot;&gt;subscribing on Patreon&lt;/a&gt;, or with a &lt;a href=&quot;https://xanasoft.com/go.php?to=donate&quot;&gt;PayPal donation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;Watching another machine, and serving this one to a viewer elsewhere, are supporter features; everything TaskExplorer does on the machine it runs on needs no certificate.</string>
                 </property>
